# US Shopify store prices, daily

Daily prices, sale ("compare-at") prices and stock for every product option of {{ stores|length }} US direct-to-consumer brands on Shopify, with a change log and a monthly price history. Collected by [{{ pub.repo }}]({{ repo_url }}); this card is re-rendered after every run.

## Dataset summary

- **Latest run:** {{ f.run_date }}, {{ f.run_time }}, status `{{ q.status }}`, {{ q.stores_ok }} of {{ q.stores_total }} stores updated.
- **Rows in the latest snapshot:** {{ "{:,}".format(f.snapshot_rows) }} product options.
- **Stores by category:** {% for cat, n in categories|dictsort %}{{ cat }} {{ n }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}. The list and the evidence for every included and excluded store: [docs/sources.md]({{ repo_url }}/blob/{{ pub.branch }}/docs/sources.md).
- **Cadence:** one run a day at 06:17 UTC ({{ bfcm_runs }} a day from 26 Nov to 1 Dec 2026).

## Files

| File | Rows | Content |
|---|---|---|
| `latest/snapshot.csv` | one per product option | current price, compare-at price, stock, and since when |
| `changes/YYYY/YYYY-MM-DD.csv` | one per change | price up/down, sale start/end, sold out, back in stock, new, removed |
| `runs.jsonl` | one per run | run status, stores updated, quality counts, request counts |
| `price_history_YYYY-MM.parquet` (release asset) | one per version | full history, SCD2 with `valid_from` / `valid_to` |

Field definitions with real examples: the data dictionary in the [README]({{ repo_url }}#data-dictionary).

## Collection

- Public catalog endpoints only (`/products.json`, `/products/<handle>.js`, product pages), requested with `country=US`.
- robots.txt respected (RFC 9309); one run-wide pace for Shopify's shared edge; any `429` pauses the whole run; a challenge page stops a store; no proxies, no anti-bot bypass.
- Honest user agent: `ecommerce-price-monitor/0.1 (+{{ pub.site }})`.

## Quality checks (latest run)

- Second-source check: {{ q.js_match }} of {{ q.js_checked }} sampled products matched the product `.js` feed exactly.
- Currency proof: {{ q.usd_stores }} stores proved USD on a product page.
- Rows rejected by validation: {{ q.rows_rejected }}; $0 variants (free gifts, samples) left out: {{ "{:,}".format(q.free_variants) }}; stale compare-at prices below the price ignored: {{ "{:,}".format(q.compare_at_ignored) }}.
- A run that fails the batch guard is held and not published; the previous good data stays live.

## Limitations

- Prices are list prices shown to a US visitor; cart-level promotions, codes and shipping are not included.
- A store that could not be read keeps its last good rows (see `stores_not_updated` in `runs.jsonl`).
- Some themes publish wrong JSON-LD prices; those differences are recorded, not used (decision D-019).

## Personal data and opt-out

No personal data. No images or product descriptions. Store owners can request removal at [{{ pub.email }}](mailto:{{ pub.email }}); removal within 24 hours.

